  "integration_proposal": [
    "Tony: one sustain voice plus one bounded transient voice; fade core 40 ms on entry/exit.",
    "Do not retrigger startup for aim changes; spatial placement follows muzzle, including up/diagonal.",
    "Sean: seal/pull/break/erupt/tip/decay follow separate animation events; tip follows facing side.",
    "Duck or omit accepted HUD cue when the special start itself gives sufficient feedback.",
    "Empty cue only on a fresh rejected press, never every held frame.",
    "Two uses per hero per level and no refills are design context, not implemented here.",
    "No weapon-switch cue or runtime hookup; future square weapon-icon HUD does not imply switching.",
    "Musical/monster balance, audible loop acceptance and final timing need in-game listening."
  ],
  "sync_recipe": "audio/sources/starter-specials-auditions-v1/add_sync_cues.py",
  "art_sync_notes": [
    "Tony idle recoil scrape differs from braced stepping; neither restarts the pressure loop.",
    "Tony direction reversal preserves pressure; no aim/reversal cue is added.",
    "Sean hinge strain is separate from initial pipe release and from the water-follow tip gesture.",
    "Sean following jet can sustain through arbitrary tilt duration, then crossfade into irregular decay.",
    "Preview uses one finite core pass; durations remain illustrative, not approved mechanics."
  ]
